            "\n",
            "Enter your move (1-9): 3\n",
            "Computer is thinking...\n",
            "\n",
            " O | X | X \n",
            "---+---+---\n",
            " O |   |   \n",
            "---+---+---\n",
            "   |   |   \n",
            "\n",
            "Enter your move (1-9): 6\n",
